cat << EOF
fcitx5-qt contains the Qt platform input context plugin that lets Qt
applications talk to Fcitx5, plus the Fcitx5Qt widgets library used by
configuration tools.

The plugin supports Qt5 and Qt6, on both X11 and Wayland.
EOF
